      "refersTo": "nav-active",
      "description": "三个简单模式入口；实际路由由应用管理。",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\"><a class=\"ds-nav-item\" href=\"#today\" aria-current=\"page\">今天</a><a class=\"ds-nav-item\" href=\"#inbox\">待我确认</a><a class=\"ds-nav-item\" href=\"#results\">效果</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:grid;gap:3px}.ds-nav-item{font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;font-size:13px;padding:11px 13px;min-height:22px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted,#9cabbe)}.ds-nav-item[aria-current]{background:var(--pale,#193139);color:var(--accent,#a6e8ed);border-color:var(--selected-line,#456c78)}.ds-nav-item:hover{background:var(--surface,#101720);color:var(--ink,#eef4fc)}.ds-nav-item:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus-edge,#b5f2f4);outline-offset:4px}"
    },
